

Inkqubo ulawulo-lwenkumbulo: 1.

>> x := 0.
>> y := ['Hello'].
>> q := { ['']. }.
>> p := Inyaniso.
>> a := Uluhlu ← 1 ; 2 ; 3 ; 4.
>> c := Into entsha.
c xa-kufika: ['greet:'] yenza: { Imveliso bhala: ['greet!']. }.

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.
>> usedMemory5 := 0.

Inkqubo coca.
>> usedMemory1 := (Inkqubo inkumbulo ? 0).




